# Krok 9

## WiFi CAPsMAN

Na RB4011:

### Security

```mikrotik
/interface/wifi/security
add name=SEC-USERS \
authentication-types=wpa2-psk,wpa3-psk \
passphrase="TWOJE_HASLO"
```

### Datapath

```mikrotik
/interface/wifi/datapath
add name=DP-USERS \
bridge=BRIDGE \
vlan-id=20
```

### Configuration

```mikrotik
/interface/wifi/configuration
add name=CFG-USERS \
ssid=Herbapolki \
country=Poland \
security=SEC-USERS \
datapath=DP-USERS
```

### Provisioning

```mikrotik
/interface/wifi/provisioning
add action=create-enabled \
master-configuration=CFG-USERS \
supported-bands=2ghz-ax
```

```mikrotik
/interface/wifi/provisioning
add action=create-enabled \
master-configuration=CFG-USERS \
supported-bands=5ghz-ax
```

---

# Krok 10

## hAP ax2

Na obu:

```mikrotik
/interface/wifi/cap
set enabled=yes \
caps-man-addresses=10.30.0.1
```

